increase, we've passed through 45% of that to clients, but still deposit beta is very low relative to where we thought it would be at this time.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"RJF 2018 Q3","e":"rjf","d":"2018-07-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey Julien","x":"But with respect to the March increase that we had, we also passed through a little bit more than half.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"RJF 2019 Q1","e":"rjf","d":"2019-01-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeff Julien","x":"Further, we passed through I think about 50% of the September Fed rate hike to clients, which is higher than most of the competition.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"RJF 2019 Q2","e":"rjf","d":"2019-04-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeff Julien","x":"But that decline throughout the March quarter was more than offset by the increased spread that we earned as we had not passed through any of the December Fed hike to clients throughout that quarter.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"RJF 2019 Q3","e":"rjf","d":"2019-07-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Reilly","x":"However, we did go through the process of rightsizing the Fixed Income business somewhat and expenses during the year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"RJF 2019 Q4","e":"rjf","d":"2019-10-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul Reilly","x":"We had tariffs on.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"RJF 2019 Q4","e":"rjf","d":"2019-10-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul Reilly","x":"We had tariffs off.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"RJF 2019 Q4","e":"rjf","d":"2019-10-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeff Julien","x":"We passed through 13 of the 25.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"RJF 2019 Q4","e":"rjf","d":"2019-10-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeff Julien","x":"And we passed through 60%, 15 basis points to clients.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"RJF 2020 Q4","e":"rjf","d":"2020-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Reilly","x":"We experienced social unrest in our country, uncertain economic outlooks, a presidential and congressional election, and a reduction in force which is extremely rare at Raymond James.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"RJF 2020 Q4","e":"rjf","d":"2020-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Reilly","x":"Quarterly expenses were higher, due mainly to compensation expense associated with higher compensation compensable revenues, and reduction in workforce expense incurred during the quarter.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"RJF 2023 Q2","e":"rjf","d":"2023-04-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Alexander Blostein","x":"And just given your outlook for effectively peak rates revenues in a challenging capital markets backdrop, when should we expect you guys to become a little bit more aggressive on cost savings initiatives?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"RJF 2024 Q1","e":"rjf","d":"2024-01-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Shoukry","x":"So we still think that there's pricing power.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"RJF 2024 Q1","e":"rjf","d":"2024-01-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Shoukry","x":"But in fairness, the pricing power we're talking about is 5 basis points to 10 basis points, which on the balances of $17 billion is meaningful, but it pales in comparison to what's happening with the base rates nowadays and what might happen, going down or up.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"RJF 2026 Q1","e":"rjf","d":"2026-01-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Paul Shoukry","x":"And that's hard to remain competitive when you can't invest in AI and the tools that you need to help advisers develop more efficiency in their businesses with their clients.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/28/raymond-james-rjf-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RJF 2026 Q1","e":"rjf","d":"2026-01-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Paul Shoukry","x":"I mean, if you look just at our investment in cybersecurity, the growth of AI investments and the development that we're doing with applications across all of our businesses, the infrastructure investment, there's a lot that goes into it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/28/raymond-james-rjf-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RJF 2026 Q1","e":"rjf","d":"2026-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Shoukry","x":"We continue to make investments and implement solutions to automate and streamline processes that provide advisers with incremental time to invest in their client relationships.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/28/raymond-james-rjf-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RJF 2026 Q2","e":"rjf","d":"2026-04-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Paul Shoukry","x":"We will continue investing in automation, process improvement and AI as part of our more than $1.1 billion annual technology spend to create efficiencies, give advisers more time to deepen client relationships and further enhance the client experience.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/raymond-james-rjf-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RJF 2026 Q2","e":"rjf","d":"2026-04-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Shoukry","x":"But what we're all wondering is the next phase of AI really is around Agentic AI and what can Agentic AI do to improve processes and streamline processes and ultimately the cost curve across not only our industry, but all industries.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/raymond-james-rjf-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RJF 2026 Q4","e":"rjf","d":"2026-10-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Paul Shoukry","x":"To that end, we are making significant investments in technology and AI, not with a focus on disintermediating our financial advisers, but instead, with a focus on saving our advisers and associates time on administrative tasks so they can spend more time developing deeply personal relationships…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/raymond-james-rjf-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RJF 2026 Q4","e":"rjf","d":"2026-10-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Paul Shoukry","x":"So that is something -- I mean, if you look at our technology investments, that are focused on the front office and the AI focus, for example, we just have a rollout of what we call the meeting manager workflow, which is saving advisers hours and hours a week through AI to not only prepare for…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/raymond-james-rjf-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RJF 2026 Q4","e":"rjf","d":"2026-10-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul Shoukry","x":"I mean we had the tariffs a year ago, a year plus ago, and then we had the AI concerns that impacted fintech earlier this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/raymond-james-rjf-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[28,1,11091,0,0,0,8569,2085],[30,1,9256,0,0,0,7969,1059],[31,1,7687,0,0,0,6736,735],[32,1,10397,0,0,0,8254,1811],[33,1,9055,0,0,0,7776,905],[34,1,8765,0,0,0,7049,1304],[35,1,8588,0,0,0,7153,1061],[36,1,10554,0,0,0,8018,2097],[37,1,8970,0,0,0,7048,1617],[38,1,8965,0,0,0,7396,1209],[39,1,10260,0,0,0,87